{"Mihawk (mihawk-99) brought the Dolphin core to the PS5. Porpoise is built on his port of Dolphin and RetroArch.", {"Mihawk (mihawk-99) llevó el núcleo de Dolphin a PS5. Porpoise se basa en su port de Dolphin y RetroArch.", "Mihawk (mihawk-99) a porté le cœur Dolphin sur PS5. Porpoise repose sur son portage de Dolphin et RetroArch.", "Mihawk (mihawk-99) trouxe o núcleo do Dolphin para a PS5. O Porpoise assenta no port dele do Dolphin e do RetroArch.", "Mihawk (mihawk-99) ha portato il core Dolphin su PS5. Porpoise si basa sul suo port di Dolphin e RetroArch.", "Mihawk（mihawk-99）がDolphinコアをPS5に移植しました。Porpoiseは、彼によるDolphinとRetroArchの移植をもとに作られています。", "Mihawk (mihawk-99) llevó el núcleo de Dolphin a PS5. Porpoise se basa en su port de Dolphin y RetroArch.", "Mihawk (mihawk-99) trouxe o núcleo do Dolphin para o PS5. O Porpoise é baseado no port dele do Dolphin e do RetroArch.", "Mihawk (mihawk-99) hat den Dolphin-Core auf die PS5 gebracht. Porpoise basiert auf seinem Port von Dolphin und RetroArch.", "Mihawk (mihawk-99) bracht de Dolphin-core naar de PS5. Porpoise is gebouwd op zijn port van Dolphin en RetroArch.", "Mihawk (mihawk-99) przeniósł rdzeń Dolphin na PS5. Porpoise opiera się na jego porcie Dolphin i RetroArch.", "Mihawk (mihawk-99) перенёс ядро Dolphin на PS5. Porpoise построен на его порте Dolphin и RetroArch.", "Mihawk（mihawk-99）将Dolphin核心移植到了PS5。Porpoise基于他移植的Dolphin和RetroArch打造。", "Mihawk（mihawk-99）將 Dolphin 核心移植到 PS5。Porpoise 建立在他移植的 Dolphin 與 RetroArch 之上。", "Mihawk (mihawk-99)가 Dolphin 코어를 PS5로 가져왔습니다. Porpoise는 그가 이식한 Dolphin과 RetroArch를 바탕으로 만들어졌습니다.", "Mihawk (mihawk-99), Dolphin çekirdeğini PS5'e taşıdı. Porpoise, onun Dolphin ve RetroArch portu üzerine kuruludur.", "Mihawk (mihawk-99) portade Dolphin-kärnan till PS5. Porpoise bygger på hans portar av Dolphin och RetroArch."}},
